eight of 90.5 feet (27.6 m). The falls is one of the more popular attractions in the area, due to ease of access and proximity to U.S. Highway 101.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marymere_Falls","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","attribution":"Wikipedia"},"photos":[{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Marymere_Falls_2022.jpg/960px-Marymere_Falls_2022.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Marymere_Falls_2022.jpg","dist_m":10,"width":640,"height":853,"license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","artist":"Sea Cow"},{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/Lower_Marymere_Fall.jpg/960px-Lower_Marymere_Fall.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lower_Marymere_Fall.jpg","dist_m":20,"width":640,"height":960,"license":"CC BY-SA 2.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0","artist":"stevehfung"},{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cd/Crossing_the_Bridge.jpg/960px-Crossing_the_Bridge.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Crossing_the_Bridge.jpg","dist_m":23,"width":640,"height":960,"license":"CC BY-SA 2.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0","artist":"stevehfung"},{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5e/Roots_trees_forest_green_ferns_Marymere_falls_trail_cbubar_2015_%2823060405392%29.jpg/960px-Roots_trees_forest_green_ferns_Marymere_falls_trail_cbubar_2015_%2823060405392%29.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Roots_trees_forest_green_ferns_Marymere_falls_trail_cbubar_2015_(23060405392).jpg","dist_m":129,"width":640,"height":853,"license":"Public domain","license_url":"","artist":"Olympic National Park"},{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5c/Roots_trees_forest_green_ferns_Marymere_falls_trail_cbubar_2015_%2822983474631%29.jpg/960px-Roots_trees_forest_green_ferns_Marymere_falls_trail_cbubar_2015_